        "cooked": "<p>In case you did not see <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/content/new-community-manager\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the announcement on the main site</a>, I wanted to announce here that we just hired Craig to be our full time Community Manager! He will be moving to STL by the beginning of December and will be:</p><ul>\n<li><span>Managing GTG Presence at Conventions</span></li>\n<li>Administering these forums</li>\n<li>Responding to the&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:contact@greaterthangames.com\">contact@greaterthangames.com</a>&nbsp;email address</li>\n<li>Helping us pack a million boxes all the time</li>\n<li>Various other things</li>\n</ul>",
